---
description: Specifications governing persisted results and generated Terraform
globs: headroom/write_results.py,headroom/parse_results.py,headroom/terraform/**/*.py,headroom/placement/**/*.py,test_environment/modules/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- [spec/contracts/results.md](mdc:spec/contracts/results.md) - result JSON
  schema, filenames, redaction, resume. A filename change can silently re-scan
  or silently skip accounts without any reader failing.
- [spec/contracts/placement.md](mdc:spec/contracts/placement.md) - placement
  levels, safety predicates, allowlist unions.
- [spec/contracts/terraform.md](mdc:spec/contracts/terraform.md) - generated
  files, the ownership marker, reconciliation, module variables.
- [spec/contracts/policy-model.md](mdc:spec/contracts/policy-model.md) and the
  affected `spec/checks/*` documents - for `test_environment/modules/`, where
  the statements themselves live rather than the calls to them.
